start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch [3dc 2ch]x3 dc}@ring ss@top ss@sp
R2: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@sp [3dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp]x3 dc 2dc ss@sp # last 2 dc into the 2 sl sts of the previous round
R3: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@sp [7dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp]x3 5dc 2dc ss@sp
R4: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@sp [11dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp]x3 9dc 2dc ss@sp
R5: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@sp [15dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp]x3 13dc 2dc ss@sp
R6: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@sp [19dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp]x3 17dc 2dc ss@sp
R7: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@sp [23dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@sp]x3 21dc 2dc ss@sp
